{"ticker":"CMCSA","updated":"2026-10-23T22:46:45Z","profile":{"longName":"Comcast Corporation","shortName":"Comcast Corporation","sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Telecom Services","country":"United States","website":"https://corporate.comcast.com","fullTimeEmployees":179000,"marketCap":80518569984,"trailingPE":7.18038,"forwardPE":6.4036355,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.6545959,"pegRatio":142.98,"targetMeanPrice":28.15909,"targetHighPrice":42.0,"targetLowPrice":17.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":22,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":-0.061,"earningsGrowth":0.076,"grossMargins":0.69844,"operatingMargins":0.18158,"profitMargins":0.092,"totalRevenue":123005001728,"beta":null,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":32.86,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":20.48,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":5.78},"summary":"Comcast Corporation operates as a media and technology company worldwide. The company operates through Residential Connectivity & Platforms, Business Services Connectivity, Media, Studios, and Theme Parks segments. Its Residential Connectivity & Platforms segment provides residential broadband and wireless connectivity services, residential and business video services, sky-branded entertainment television networks, and advertising. The Business Services Connectivity segment offers connectivity services for small business locations, which include broadband, wireline voice, and wireless services; and ethernet network services for medium-sized customers and larger enterprises. Its Media segment operates NBCUniversal's national and regional cable networks; the NBC and Telemundo broadcast networks and owned local broadcast television stations; and Peacock, a direct-to-consumer streaming services. The company also operates international television networks comprising the Sky Sports networks, as well as other digital properties. Its Studios segment operates NBCUniversal and Sky film and television studio production and distribution operations. The Theme Parks segment operates Universal theme parks in Orlando, Florida; Hollywood, California; Osaka, Japan; and Beijing, China. It also offers a consolidated streaming platforms under the Philadelphia Flyers and the Xfinity Mobile Arena in ","summary_zh":"康卡斯特公司是一家全球媒體和科技公司。該公司透過住宅連接和平台、商業服務連接、媒體、工作室和主題公園部門進行營運。其住宅連接和平台部門提供住宅寬頻和無線連接服務、住宅和商業視訊服務、天空品牌娛樂電視網路和廣告。商業服務連接部門為小型企業場所提供連接服務，包括寬頻、有線語音和無線服務；以及針對中型客戶和大型企業的乙太網路服務。其媒體部門經營 NBCUniversal 的全國和地區有線電視網路； NBC 和 Telemundo 廣播網路以及擁有的當地廣播電視台； Peacock，一個直接面向消費者的串流媒體服務。該公司還運營包括天空體育網路在內的國際電視網路以及其他數位資產。其工作室部門經營 NBCUniversal 和 Sky 電影和電視工作室的製作和發行業務。主題樂園部門在佛羅裡達州奧蘭多經營環球主題樂園；加州好萊塢；日本大阪；和中國北京。它還在費城飛人隊和 Xfinity 行動競技場下提供綜合串流媒體平台","sector_zh":"通訊服務","industry_zh":"電信服務","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":31.9119,"h":32.0337,"l":31.6963,"c":31.8744,"v":18296276},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":31.8463,"h":31.8463,"l":31.4152,"c":31.5651,"v":23766145},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":31.4808,"h":31.7245,"l":31.3496,"c":31.687,"v":18694587},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":31.7245,"h":31.7619,"l":31.1715,"c":31.462,"v":22818329},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":31.4527,"h":31.8557,"l":31.3589,"c":31.8369,"v":17850910},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":31.5839,"h":32.015,"l":31.537,"c":31.9869,"v":21662341},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":32.0056,"h":32.0337,"l":31.3777,"c":31.7619,"v":19108583},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":31.8932,"h":32.2868,"l":31.6026,"c":31.8182,"v":29809633},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":31.9494,"h":32.2212,"l":31.4808,"c":31.7807,"v":22531732},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":30.5248,"h":31.9681,"l":30.478,"c":31.865,"v":29665908},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":31.8557,"h":31.9025,"l":31.5558,"c":31.5558,"v":18289981},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":31.4246,"h":31.6214,"l":30.8341,"c":31.3777,"v":18866267},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":31.3589,"h":31.4527,"l":31.0965,"c":31.3027,"v":23239900},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":31.1809,"h":31.284,"l":30.4124,"c":30.9841,"v":25474412},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":30.956,"h":31.0684,"l":30.478,"c":30.5717,"v":22823023},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":30.5717,"h":30.7029,"l":29.9719,"c":30.2624,"v":23070781},{"t":"2025-09-